        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Rev Theory\n- Organizations: WWE\n- Events: Extreme Rules (2011)\n- Products: Justice, The Revelation, Take 'Em Out\n- Places: St. Pete Times Forum, Tampa, Florida\n\nFacts:\n- WWE produced Extreme Rules (2011), a professional wrestling pay-per-view event that took place on May 1, 2011 at the St. Pete Times Forum in Tampa, Florida.\n- The song \"Justice\" was used for WWE's Extreme Rules (2011).\n- Rev Theory released \"Take 'Em Out\" as a four-song EP.\n- \"The Revelation\" was Rev Theory's first full-length studio album since \"Justice\".",
